Tabletist bundles these, each under its own licence:

- IBM Plex Sans and IBM Plex Mono (assets/fonts/IBMPlex*.ttf),
  SIL Open Font License 1.1, see assets/fonts/IBMPlex-OFL.txt.
- JetBrains Mono (assets/fonts/JetBrainsMono-Variable.ttf),
  SIL Open Font License 1.1, see assets/fonts/JetBrainsMono-OFL.txt.
- Noto Sans Symbols 2, subset to the keyboard symbols
  (assets/fonts/NotoSansSymbols2-Keys.ttf), SIL Open Font License 1.1, see
  assets/fonts/NotoSansSymbols2-OFL.txt.
- Lucide icons (assets/icons/*.svg), ISC License, see assets/icons/LICENSE.txt.
